note: top_level — statements at the top level are the program body

to band with score as number giving text:
    if score is at least 90:
        give back "gold"
    if score is at least 50:
        give back "pass"
    give back "retry"

let scores be a list of 95, 60, 12
for each s in scores:
    say "{s}: {(band with s)}"

note: `otherwise` supplies the value to use when a maybe is nothing,
note: so a missing or unreadable input never stops the program.
let entered be (number from "not a number") otherwise 0
say "entered: {entered}"
